# Marvin, Murderous Mimic: "...creatures you control that don't have the same name as this creature". Mirror Gallery ("the
# 'legend rule' doesn't apply") lets Bot1 keep two Marvins, the second equipped with Paradise Mantle ("{T}: Add one mana of
# any color"). The first has Llanowar Elves' mana ability and only that: the other Marvin has the same name, so what he has -
# the Mantle's ability - is no one's to take (a second ability is refused).

